{"version":1,"content":"<p>今年萬聖節，除了旅發局首辦「香港萬聖月」的跨區Cosplay街頭派對（中環皇后像廣場花園及遮打道、蘭桂坊、啟德體育園、旺角朗豪坊及尖東麼地道花園），還有不同機構各自的萬聖節慶祝活動，本文精選10月30日至11月1日各區活動，方便市民規劃安排。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:00.671226+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:03:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:18:14.019928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:18.389026+00:00","content_hash":"ca161ce9e6e2778b437764642bf2acc6ace030f25e47b7c9a44e2336656ce63e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}